From c5aa38b96567720da8fe66504424681e128a1ac0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Madara273 <ravenhoxs@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 23:25:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] qcacld-3.0: Add hybrid injection method using Direct-DP and
 WMI

Runtime controls:
echo 0 > /sys/module/wma/parameters/injection_direct_dp
Route all injected frames through WMI (default).
echo 1 > /sys/module/wma/parameters/injection_direct_dp

Route data frames through direct DP, while management/control frames remain on WMI.
Both modes are currently stable. The exception is routing everything through "direct_dp", which still produces poor results even when configured as a separate sniffer TX path.
Test results typically range from approximately 3/30 to 11/30 on average.
This requires further investigation.

Signed-off-by: Madara273 <ravenhoxs@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Robin <hanya8493@gmail.com>
